[{"type":"message","user":"U02CFNPK2UA","text":"\u003c@U02CFNPK2UA\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1629985694.046600","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"70abe818-56c3-409f-8baf-eacd84aa39da","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"内蔵Luaでファイルサイズが返ってきた時には既に解析などが終わっている状態でしょうし。","ts":"1629977012.046300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MVDU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"744d75e5-8015-451c-ab35-d0253667a2c5","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"となると別のアプローチとして読み込む際のサイズを事前計算して規定以上であればsyntaxをオフにするみたいな処理を書けとなりますが、Neovim上だけでやるとしたら難しいでしょうね…。","ts":"1629976889.045500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l0Gv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"03d1720e-54a1-427c-b003-805948385fbb","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"そして synmaxcol を指定して意味がある = はみ出た部分に色がつかない、ということなので、極端に横に長いファイルに適用したり極端に小さい値に設定したりした場合、syntax を off にするのと効果がさほど変わらなかったりします。","ts":"1629976230.043900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A61m1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba319e93-7a6f-44ce-a3d9-ef292041e5e6","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"そもそも synmaxcol は横に長いファイル、たとえば整形されていない XML みたいなものには意味ありますが、通常の（100文字程度のオーダーで改行されている）プログラムではあまり関係なさそう。","ts":"1629976076.042100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rYuq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd24dfd2-4ed1-4373-89d4-8a5140001cb9","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"今適当なファイルで `synmaxcol=10` にしてやってみましたが、 tree-sitter でハイライトしているときはこの設定効かないみたいですね","ts":"1629975787.040400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"majika","count":1,"users":["U022PB40WAF"]},{"name":"yahari","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bQn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5514dbf8-1c47-4d37-aba6-8c3e89d973e5","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"Treesitterとしても同じ設定値を共有しているだろうから同じような振る舞いをするのでは？","ts":"1629974590.039400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ypwm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6fdd413-3048-4497-97b2-5e2c5dbf565a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"雑にgrepかけてみたけど何も出てこなかった","ts":"1629974390.038500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PvBUO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6db0f399-190f-4b5c-a7f7-83b57b52796a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"treesitterってsynmaxcol見るんだろうか","ts":"1629974116.037100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NRVJg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b59098ab-93cd-4dd5-ad5d-54fabc3b234b","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"この設定が役に立つかも。","ts":"1629973780.036400","thread_ts":"1629971374.029400","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wUub"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"ce0bce86-d63c-49ee-aec2-db9dd988bd7e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"treesitter切ってsyntax offしたら爆速になった","ts":"1629971374.029400","thread_ts":"1629971374.029400","reply_count":3,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0B4e"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"02865f91-12a5-42d4-97ea-fbe3fe5976cc","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":":h synmaxcol","ts":"1629973734.035900","thread_ts":"1629971374.029400","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=szmm"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"ce0bce86-d63c-49ee-aec2-db9dd988bd7e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"treesitter切ってsyntax offしたら爆速になった","ts":"1629971374.029400","thread_ts":"1629971374.029400","reply_count":3,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0B4e"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"c825c2ef-d97b-4da1-9894-81363fabea51","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/10939637934507772535\u003e\nさすがに、タイトルが要訳に入ってるのはなー と思い、本文だけいれたけど、殆ど変わらなかった…","ts":"1629973592.035700","attachments":[{"fallback":"ELYZA DIGEST","id":1,"title":"ELYZA DIGEST","title_link":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/10939637934507772535","text":"要約結果は \"メロスが、邪悪に敏感な男に激怒した。王は、メロスの無二の友人を人質として殺害し、三日目に殺害した。王は、メロスの心はわからないと、暴君に激怒した。\" でした。","thumb_url":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/static/og.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"digest.elyza.ai","thumb_width":1920,"thumb_height":800,"from_url":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/10939637934507772535","original_url":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/10939637934507772535"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6I2pL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6b39756-b603-408a-9376-44769f59079b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"圧縮新聞を思い出している","ts":"1629973192.034900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0/i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58f5a53e-c084-4f81-8e00-86a3045da19c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"走れメロスとんでもないことになったわw\n\n\u003chttps://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/13343866594427750592\u003e","ts":"1629973042.034200","attachments":[{"fallback":"ELYZA DIGEST","id":1,"title":"ELYZA DIGEST","title_link":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/13343866594427750592","text":"要約結果は \"走れメロス太宰治が、邪智暴虐の王を除かなければならぬと決意した。王は、メロスの無二の友人を人質として殺害し、三日目に殺害した。王は、メロスの罪を永遠にゆるしてやろうと、激怒した。\" でした。","thumb_url":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/static/og.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"digest.elyza.ai","thumb_width":1920,"thumb_height":800,"from_url":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/13343866594427750592","original_url":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/13343866594427750592"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fuita","count":5,"users":["U022PB40WAF","UD1FQV38V","U017BU3UZBQ","U81LLJ340","UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F=in"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cde97bbd-fd1f-4211-a3d3-37d25b730394","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"コレは悪くない\n\n\u003chttps://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/7419156824993382894\u003e","ts":"1629972538.033700","attachments":[{"fallback":"ELYZA DIGEST","id":1,"title":"ELYZA DIGEST","title_link":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/7419156824993382894","text":"要約結果は \"Vimの日本の統合コミュニティvim-jpを立ち上げることをお知らせしている。vim-jpはVimと日本・日本語に関わるあらゆるリソースを集中させることが主な目的。継続的に間口の広い、参加しやすいコミュニティになっていくことをお約束している。\" でした。","thumb_url":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/static/og.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"digest.elyza.ai","thumb_width":1920,"thumb_height":800,"from_url":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/7419156824993382894","original_url":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/7419156824993382894"}],"edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1629972552.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u8Kw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30e58fa3-f7c0-4f7f-ab60-438642a1841b","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/12926757560259921494\u003e\n文章をそのまま入れても微妙だ…","ts":"1629972456.033400","attachments":[{"fallback":"ELYZA DIGEST","id":1,"title":"ELYZA DIGEST","title_link":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/12926757560259921494","text":"要約結果は \"当時、vim-devで開発していた学生が、日本人からと思われる投稿を見つけた。当時、vimのマニュアルを読み、添付されているサンプルの設定を利用した。英語でメールを書いたのは最初で、日本人からと思われる投稿を見つけた。\" でした。","thumb_url":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/static/og.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"digest.elyza.ai","thumb_width":1920,"thumb_height":800,"from_url":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/12926757560259921494","original_url":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/12926757560259921494"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wReT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb9b0bc6-2460-491a-ae5a-9d9623c6b477","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"根性が足らない感じ。最初の10行だけ読んで3行にまとめてる印象。\n\n\u003chttps://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/15173870790853348764\u003e","ts":"1629972397.032700","attachments":[{"fallback":"ELYZA DIGEST","id":1,"title":"ELYZA DIGEST","title_link":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/15173870790853348764","text":"要約結果は \"自作キーボードを始めて5か月の歩み、その遍歴を振り返っている。自作キーボード初心者に毛が生えた程度の自分ではあまりに高すぎる壁。ハンダ付け難度は道具も揃っていないため、苦労の末にLEDを全点灯させた。\" でした。","thumb_url":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/static/og.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"digest.elyza.ai","thumb_width":1920,"thumb_height":800,"from_url":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/15173870790853348764","original_url":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/15173870790853348764"}],"edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1629972421.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gJ6Ma"}]},{"client_msg_id":"623429a5-a69e-479c-ba83-ed6f028f8fad","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なるほど","ts":"1629972304.031900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RPuZC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bbfbb44a-712c-4269-9c1d-b38e1c6d39e1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ふむ。なろう小説でも入れてみるか。","ts":"1629972250.031600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WznUk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3511bcbc-18da-4cb7-aed3-ed88c4cc5a94","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"どうしてそうなるねん…\n\u003chttps://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/12275962194178296408\u003e","ts":"1629972205.031200","attachments":[{"fallback":"ELYZA DIGEST","id":1,"title":"ELYZA DIGEST","title_link":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/12275962194178296408","text":"要約結果は \"あるGoogle勤務のBramが、海外旅行で訪れた過去を語っている。旅行で訪れた谷中の風景をとても気に入った、というエピソード。飛行機の運転手は、飛行機の運転手と会話する時間がない。\" でした。","thumb_url":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/static/og.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"digest.elyza.ai","thumb_width":1920,"thumb_height":800,"from_url":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/12275962194178296408","original_url":"https://www.digest.elyza.ai/summaries/12275962194178296408"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MJZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e93872c-c462-4038-8db2-32ca4bc374b1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"これを要約したらこうなった…\n\n\u0026gt; 当時、VIM-DEVで活動していた筆者が、日本人からと思われる投稿を見つけた。日本人からと思われる投稿を見つけたという。彼は「とりあえずパッチできたから必要かどうかわからないけど送るわ」と語った。\n\u003chttps://www.kaoriya.net/blog/2011/08/20110811/\u003e","ts":"1629972103.030900","attachments":[{"fallback":"Vim昔語/遭遇編 — KaoriYa","id":1,"title":"Vim昔語/遭遇編 — KaoriYa","title_link":"https://www.kaoriya.net/blog/2011/08/20110811/","text":"mattnさんのエントリを読んでいたら懐かしくなったので思い出話でも。","blocks":null,"service_name":"kaoriya.net","service_icon":"https://www.kaoriya.net/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.kaoriya.net/blog/2011/08/20110811/","original_url":"https://www.kaoriya.net/blog/2011/08/20110811/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8npl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3375c4dc-46f0-4657-9be2-217287b74b12","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"うーん要約、ちょっと食わせてみたけどイマイチだな?","ts":"1629972008.030500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zlw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"25cbe34f-1cae-40de-9ba0-ab6324f7032f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"Vimで\n```\t\t\t\t\t\t*'syntax'* *'syn'*\n'syntax' 'syn'\t\t文字列\t(既定では \"\")\n\t\t\tバッファについてローカル\n\t\t\t{|+syntax| 機能付きでコンパイルされたときのみ有効}```","ts":"1629971443.030200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original